# Datasets and training data

Dialogue data: `src/claynext/models/datasets/`, CLI `claynext dataset`, files under `data/datasets/`. Docs: `docs/khmer-platform/`.

Speech data: `src/claynext/voice_training/` (dry-run scaffold). Guides: `docs/voice_training/`, `docs/khmer_spoken/`, `docs/guides/m4-mac-mini-start.md`.

- Version snapshots are immutable. Do not rewrite a hashed version.
- Training rows need a licence and recorded consent (`voice_training/ingestion/rights_validator.py`). No unclear audio.
- Import, dedupe, split, review export, promote, and SFT export already exist. Do not rebuild them.
- Do not start a training or hosted fine-tune unless the owner approved that job. Until then, dry-run only (`voice_training/training/tts_trainer.py`).
